WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0097: the camera bumps into nothing, the see-through takes what is in its way.

Playtest feedback: "have the camera ignore all collisions altogether and implement the see through thing on walls,
ceilings, roofs and thick items like thick posts and trees and cloth ceilings in tents; little fences and
meats and decor and lamp posts dont need to become see through." The plugin stopped moving the eye, so the
capsule now runs outdoors too and cuts terrain (the floor rule of 0095 stays: nothing under 0.35 yd over her
feet), and record bit 20 means a little piece (`phase_out::is_little`) that is never cut.

